{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scientist needs your help to pack for a conference trip, but be sure not to pack any hot items next to any meltable items, nor any liquid containers next to any electronics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A family needs your help to pack their rucksacks for a camping trip, but the childrens' plushies are very picky about who and what they're packed near!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rock musician needs your :-- well, you get the idea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outpacked is a logic puzzle game about efficiently packing items into grid-based inventories while satisfying their various constraints. Think &quot;Tetris meets Sudoku&quot;.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012320?t=1766192232","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012320?t=1766192232","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012320/0f3ec92029d50e223406a34c5099ff9ff82ef857/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766192232","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012320/0f3ec92029d50e223406a34c5099ff9ff82ef857/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766192232","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4068820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scientist needs your help to pack for a conference trip, but be sure not to pack any hot items next to any meltable items, nor any liquid containers next to any electronics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A family needs your help to pack their rucksacks for a camping trip, but the childrens' plushies are very picky about who and what they're packed near!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rock musician needs your :-- well, you get the idea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outpacked is a logic puzzle game about efficiently packing items into grid-based inventories while satisfying their various constraints. Think &quot;Tetris meets Sudoku&quot;.</p>","developers":["Antikythera Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012320/7923776a2d11badd3641cd9ab9900e1fdd319ecf/header.jpg?t=1766192232","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4012320/2016604326/e1bca129702ff9949e617c320ae976de96960287/1761149067/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761149590","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4012320/2016604326/e1bca129702ff9949e617c320ae976de96960287/1761149067/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761149590","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4012320/2016604326/e1bca129702ff9949e617c320ae976de96960287/1761149067/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761149590","id":257221156,"name":"Gameplay Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257221156/8658cc52456f0c86a9f4f377a7909ec1f9a2b578/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761149590"}],"name":"Outpacked","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Potato PC</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["Antikythe